  {
   "id": "l1b",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 950,
   "y": 300,
   "width": 648,
   "height": 65,
   "strokeColor": "#64748b",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "seed": 100071,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 700497,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Hashing DESTROYS lexicographic locality, so keys sharing a prefix scatter\nacross every shard. Fan out to all, merge-sort in the API service, return 1,000.\nAnd pagination cannot be an offset - 'next 1,000 after X' re-queries every\nshard again. With 64 shards that is 64 queries PER PAGE.",
   "originalText": "Hashing DESTROYS lexicographic locality, so keys sharing a prefix scatter\nacross every shard. Fan out to all, merge-sort in the API service, return 1,000.\nAnd pagination cannot be an offset - 'next 1,000 after X' re-queries every\nshard again. With 64 shards that is 64 queries PER PAGE.",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
