   "x": 1360,
   "y": 452,
   "width": 415,
   "height": 130,
   "strokeColor": "#64748b",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "seed": 100085,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 700595,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Sharded on bucket_id ALONE, clustered on\n(bucket_id, object_key) - so one bucket's keys\nlive on ONE shard, in lexicographic order.\nA prefix list becomes a single-shard range scan,\nand pagination is just continuing that scan.\n\nCQRS applied to a schema: a write-optimized\ntable plus a read-optimized projection, fed by CDC.",
   "originalText": "Sharded on bucket_id ALONE, clustered on\n(bucket_id, object_key) - so one bucket's keys\nlive on ONE shard, in lexicographic order.\nA prefix list becomes a single-shard range scan,\nand pagination is just continuing that scan.\n\nCQRS applied to a schema: a write-optimized\ntable plus a read-optimized projection, fed by CDC.",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "l3",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 950,
   "y": 600,
   "width": 194,
   "height": 17,
   "strokeColor": "#b45309",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "seed": 100086,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 700602,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "The three honest costs",
   "originalText": "The three honest costs",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "l3b",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 950,
   "y": 626,
   "width": 697,
   "height": 81,
   "strokeColor": "#64748b",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "seed": 100087,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 700609,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "LIST becomes EVENTUALLY CONSISTENT - a just-uploaded object may not appear for a\nsecond, while GET on it works immediately. Real object stores behave exactly this way.\nA hot shard per hot bucket, since one bucket's rows are all co-located.\nAnd it makes listing a billion keys POSSIBLE, not fast - a million sequential pages is\na million requests however well indexed. Listing is slow by construction.",
   "originalText": "LIST becomes EVENTUALLY CONSISTENT - a just-uploaded object may not appear for a\nsecond, while GET on it works immediately. Real object stores behave exactly this way.\nA hot shard per hot bucket, since one bucket's rows are all co-located.\nAnd it makes listing a billion keys POSSIBLE, not fast - a million sequential pages is\na million requests however well indexed. Listing is slow by construction.",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "d2",
